# DISABLED FOR LOCAL AUTHORITY

This file is retained only as historical documentation of the former
`sgh-ci.yml` workflow.

It is **not**:

- canonical CI;
- production validation;
- local authority execution;
- evidence generation.

## Canonical validation path

```text
./scripts/local-ci.sh
```

Execution chain:

```text
scripts/local-ci.sh
  -> scripts/run-local-ci.py
  -> local validation
  -> local reports
  -> local SCAR evidence
```

No GitHub Actions execution is authorized by this repository's canonical local
CI policy. No hosted runners, automatic artifact uploads, automatic commits, or
automatic pushes are authorized by this archival record.

The authoritative local policy is documented in:

```text
docs/LOCAL_FIRST_REPOSITORY_GOVERNANCE.md
```
